I am Malith Praveen, a First-Class Honors graduate and batch top from Wolverhampton University, based in Sri Lanka. With over two years of hands-on experience in securing applications and systems, I'm passionate about diving deep into application security. I currently hold a Certified Ethical Hacker (CEH) certification and continuously sharpen my skills in cloud security, penetration testing, and IAM.

Beyond my technical expertise, I enjoy sharing my knowledge through cybersecurity blogging, aiming to contribute to the broader community. Connect with me on LinkedIn to explore potential collaborations and opportunities in the cybersecurity field.
